The jbocifnu have long been obsessed with my smartphone, but the
interesting thing lately is that F has started to *understand* the
thing.  That is, she'll do things like browse the picture gallery
(!!) more or less on her own, she understands when she's reached a
place she can't figure out how to get out of and will hand the phone
to me, she'll hit the power button twice to reset to a known state
(I did *not* show her the power button, I promise), etc.

This being a highly technical group, it seems likely to me that
someone has an old touchscreen something that they could sell me for
cheap for the jbocifnus'[1] use; anybody?

-Robin

